{"server":"tw","storyId":"act11mini_level_act11mini_st04","groupId":"act11mini","stageId":null,"title":"再見羅伊","storyCode":"","avgTag":"幕間","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act11mini/level_act11mini_st04.txt","sourceHash":"5983dac270a4f141192749eac10840a79427ddd0d7fe15290d1a8db4f8a40a19","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"即將按照計畫改頭換面與“青金羅伊”這個身份道別，在最後的一段時光中，羅伊遇到了同樣在卡西米爾城市裡掙扎的兩個年輕人。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_county_1"},{"type":"narration","text":"你問我，我加入無胄盟的理由？\n奇怪，這是老頭你的組織，我加入還需要什麼理由啊。\n所以這算是面試嗎？我聽說城裡的企業都搞這一套，我們以後再招新人也要這麼來嗎？那我是不是該喊你老闆？\n哎，你別嫌煩啊。\n按我看，殺手組織和企業也沒什麼不一樣的，反正都是上班，然後加班，還有安排其他人加班。\n真要說個跟著幹的理由，那肯定還是賺的錢夠多吧，比我自己打獵殺羽獸多賺不是一點半點。\n反正一樣都是瞄準——射擊，那當然是賺得多的活更讓人有幹勁啊。\n是吧老闆，畢竟大家都是想要過上好日子的嘛。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_214_1","isRemote":false,"text":"無胄盟的殺手，你們是怎麼查到這裡的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫妮克","speakerId":"avg_npc_208_1","isRemote":false,"text":"事到如今還問這種問題？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_209_1","isRemote":false,"text":"血騎士這樣的名人，自然一舉一動都有人關注了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_209_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然閣下已經足夠小心，但......這麼說吧，能查到這裡的人可不止是我們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_214_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_209_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要找您麻煩的人可不少，我們能趕在第一個找到您，可是費了不少功夫啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_209_1","isRemote":false,"text":"時間緊迫，還請您相信我們的誠意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_214_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......相信你們？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_214_1","isRemote":false,"text":"笑話，無胄盟也配與我談信任嗎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_209_1","isRemote":false,"text":"必要的時候，我們可以不是無胄盟。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫妮克","speakerId":"avg_npc_208_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_214_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......殺手，這就是你們放任自己的手下被我殺死的理由？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_214_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們是想——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_209_1","isRemote":false,"text":"噓，看破不說破。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_209_1","isRemote":false,"text":"血騎士閣下一直是個聰明人，應該不會不懂這個道理。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_214_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_209_1","isRemote":false,"text":"幫我們一個小小的忙，也給自己一個脫身的機會，這應該是一筆很划算的買賣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_209_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這樣對我們雙方都好......你說是吧？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"無胄盟的青金大位，怎麼樣，聽起來夠厲害的吧？\n實際上賺的也確實夠多。某種意義上來說，和競技騎士差不了多少，都是拿命拼來的錢。\n想要來錢快，那多少得付出點代價，承擔點風險不是？\n不過呢，幹這行十多年，差不多也做到頭了。\n急流勇退啊，最簡單的道理，何必要逆著這個時代的洪流這麼掙扎？有更安穩的生財方法，何苦再這麼拼命呢？\n看準了時機，該上岸還是得上岸。\n給人打工，哪有自己做老闆來得舒服？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_23_G07"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫妮克","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"手術定在兩個小時後，記得準時到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫妮克","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"明天之後你就只有約爾·泰勒這一個身份，公司那邊再過兩天會讓我們露個臉，別搞砸了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫妮克","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"還有......聯合會的人看起來還沒完全相信我們和血騎士同歸於盡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫妮克","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嘖，那邊調查的人還沒完全撤走，不過無胄盟倒是已經定好新的青金人選了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫妮克","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"總之在事情完全解決之前，少在外頭露面，省得節外生枝......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫妮克","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......喂，你聽見沒有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_543_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？啊我在聽，我在聽。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_543_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老闆，麻煩給我來個最貴的套餐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_543_1","isRemote":false,"text":"直接吃不用打包，多加辣！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_543_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，莫妮克閣下，你剛剛說什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫妮克","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......去死吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_543_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那可不行，我要是死了，可憐的泰勒太太可就要直接成為寡......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_543_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......嗯，掛得真快。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_543_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（看來一切都還算順利，董事會就算現在有懷疑，也早就遲了。血騎士......他如果夠聰明，就不會這個時候跳出來攪局。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_543_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（況且人人自顧不暇，幾個“道具”的損失而已，誰都不會太在意。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_543_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（玄鐵那應該輪不著我去擔心，剩下的就是換張臉，換個身份......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_543_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_543_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（馬上就要和這張臉說拜拜了啊。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_543_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（不知道新面容順不順眼，不過不管怎麼說，應該都是不可能再像現在這麼帥了。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_543_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（哎。可惜。）"},{"type":"narration","text":"曾經的青金大位站在街道上，將自己隱藏在霓虹燈的陰影之下。\n他抬手拍了拍自己的臉頰，視線漫無目的地掃過城市光鮮亮麗的街道。\n商業樓外側的大螢幕上正播放著近期最受關注的新聞要點。\n整條街道上大大小小的螢幕似乎都播報著相似的內容，噪音與繁雜的螢幕光線讓人略微暈眩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"電視","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"血騎士在鄉村的隱居處遭遇不明人士襲擊，現場有激烈打鬥痕跡，現已確認現場殘留的血跡歸屬為血騎士本人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"電視","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"現場同時發現了大量襲擊者遺體。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"電視","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"專家指出，在這樣激烈的戰鬥之中，血騎士倖存的可能性非常微小，而殘存的大量血跡也佐證了這一推斷。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"電視","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"目前最合理的解釋是我們的前任冠軍在敗給歸來的耀騎士後，耗盡了最後的力量，與襲擊者同歸於盡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"電視","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"更多有關資訊，敬請關注我們的後續節目！直擊血騎士受襲事件真相！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_220","isRemote":false,"text":"胡說！全都是在放屁！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_220","isRemote":false,"text":"血騎士怎麼可能被區區殺手殺死，這不可能！他一定是受了傷，所以才不願意出現在那群只會搶新聞吸血的媒體面前......！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_220","isRemote":false,"text":"卑鄙無恥的暗殺者！一群陰溝裡的臭蟲！血騎士絕不會就這麼倒下！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"企業員工","speakerId":"avg_npc_223","isRemote":false,"text":"等一下，你說就說，能不能別亂揮手......哎我的腦袋！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_220","isRemote":false,"text":"......哎！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_220","isRemote":false,"text":"對、對不起，是我太激動了，你沒事吧？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"企業員工","speakerId":"avg_npc_223","isRemote":false,"text":"嘶......算我倒楣......算了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"企業員工","speakerId":"avg_npc_223","isRemote":false,"text":"那邊那位老兄，你沒被砸到吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_543_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"企業員工","speakerId":"avg_npc_223","isRemote":false,"text":"兄弟？沒事吧？該不會真的被砸到腦袋了吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_543_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......嗯？不好意思，啊，是在問我嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"企業員工","speakerId":"avg_npc_223","isRemote":false,"text":"半夜還蹲在這種地方買路邊攤的就我們三個。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_543_1","isRemote":false,"text":"說得也是。啊呀，多謝關心，我沒什麼事，只是聽著剛剛的新聞有點入神。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_220","isRemote":false,"text":"新聞全都是狗屎！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_220","isRemote":false,"text":"這些聞著味舔血的蠅蟲根本不關心血騎士的死活，他們根本什麼都沒搞明白，就敢胡說一氣！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_543_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“被耀騎士擊敗後，曾經的冠軍竟做出這種事！”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_543_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘖嘖，只要取一個好的標題，好幾天的點擊量就輕鬆到手。任誰都會好奇地點進去瞄一眼，簡直是這兩天最新的財富密碼啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_220","isRemote":false,"text":"他不該被這麼、這麼......消費！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_543_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不錯的用詞，很準確。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"企業員工","speakerId":"avg_npc_223","isRemote":false,"text":"我們公司和騎士競技有部分關聯產業，我跟著跑項目的時候還見過那位幾次，這幾天新聞一出，我們手上的項目直接就黃了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"企業員工","speakerId":"avg_npc_223","isRemote":false,"text":"哎......我本人還挺喜歡血騎士的，希望他能沒事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_220","isRemote":false,"text":"......哼，就衝你這句話，我就該請你喝一杯！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"企業員工","speakerId":"avg_npc_223","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_220","isRemote":false,"text":"當是剛才的賠禮了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_220","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼樣，我這樣的感染者請的酒，敢來嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"企業員工","speakerId":"avg_npc_223","isRemote":false,"text":"我明天還要上班......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"企業員工","speakerId":"avg_npc_223","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"企業員工","speakerId":"avg_npc_223","isRemote":false,"text":"算了，明天的事明天再說。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"企業員工","speakerId":"avg_npc_223","isRemote":false,"text":"去哪，你帶路。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_220","isRemote":false,"text":"膽子真大......那你呢，一起去不？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_543_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也邀請我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_543_1","isRemote":false,"text":"其實我一會還有點事要辦——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_543_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......不過相逢就是有緣，盛情難卻，走走走，去哪喝？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_220","isRemote":false,"text":"行，你們跟我來！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_sportsbar"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_543_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼哈，乾杯！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"企業員工","speakerId":"avg_npc_223","isRemote":false,"text":"乾！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_220","isRemote":false,"text":"......你們倆，差不多得了。我沒帶多少錢出門。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"企業員工","speakerId":"avg_npc_223","isRemote":false,"text":"其實我，嗯，認得你，你是今天比賽的那個，那個......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"企業員工","speakerId":"avg_npc_223","isRemote":false,"text":"鐵腕騎士！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"企業員工","speakerId":"avg_npc_223","isRemote":false,"text":"我被鐵腕騎士的鐵腕砸了腦袋......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_543_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈哈哈！還真是這麼回事！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_220","isRemote":false,"text":"咳，我道過歉了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"企業員工","speakerId":"avg_npc_223","isRemote":false,"text":"哎！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"企業員工","speakerId":"avg_npc_223","isRemote":false,"text":"今天真是可惜了，就差一點點就能贏，要是對面沒有那個補給包的話你就能贏了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"企業員工","speakerId":"avg_npc_223","isRemote":false,"text":"我押了你贏！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_220","isRemote":false,"text":"......你押了我？為什麼會押我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"企業員工","speakerId":"avg_npc_223","isRemote":false,"text":"因為賠率高。不然呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_220","isRemote":false,"text":"......嗯......那確實......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_220","isRemote":false,"text":"不過下回你就知道了，大多數時候都別押我們這種感染者騎士，他們不會讓我們贏。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_220","isRemote":false,"text":"我拼了一把，但還是失敗了。恐怕這回幕後的那些傢伙要看我更不順眼了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_543_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哇哦，聽起來真可怕。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_220","isRemote":false,"text":"要是我有血騎士的本事......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_543_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他不也輸給那個耀騎士了？啊，對不起，是不是不該提這個。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_220","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_220","isRemote":false,"text":"說起來，老兄你又是什麼人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"企業員工","speakerId":"avg_npc_223","isRemote":false,"text":"該不會也是什麼騎士吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_543_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有的事，我就是個剛來大城市的鄉下獵人，平時獵獵羽獸，偶爾能賣出個好價錢就算是賺了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_543_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過現在日子不好過了，就想著能不能來城裡賺一筆。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"企業員工","speakerId":"avg_npc_223","isRemote":false,"text":"比如當個競技騎士？能贏的話賺得又多又快。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_543_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，這個就算了吧，我哪有本事和騎士老爺們比。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_543_1","isRemote":false,"text":"打打殺殺的事情我不擅長的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_220","isRemote":false,"text":"你倒是精明。別看騎士競技那麼光鮮，真正賺到錢的騎士，也就那麼一小撮，我勸你還是別動這方面的心思。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_220","isRemote":false,"text":"我要不是沒其他路可選，也不會幹這行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_543_1","isRemote":false,"text":"世事難料啊，老兄。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_220","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，那時候也不過是想著在城市裡能過得更好點......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_220","isRemote":false,"text":"要是有那麼個機會，真想回去告訴幾年前的自己，別來什麼大騎士領，就乖乖留在家裡幹活。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_220","isRemote":false,"text":"一輩子種地都好......總比現在強。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"企業員工","speakerId":"avg_npc_223","isRemote":false,"text":"能賺到錢的總是少數，我贊成。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"企業員工","speakerId":"avg_npc_223","isRemote":false,"text":"競技騎士能賺的，和背後企業能拿到的真正的利潤相比，根本就不算什麼......嗝。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_543_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你醉了，兄弟。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"企業員工","speakerId":"avg_npc_223","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有，我好得很！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"企業員工","speakerId":"avg_npc_223","isRemote":false,"text":"你們說......是不是我要是感染了，明天就不用上班了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_220","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_543_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那確實。不僅明天，不出意外今後你應該就再也不用上班了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"企業員工","speakerId":"avg_npc_223","isRemote":false,"text":"算了當我什麼都沒說......嗝，哎，我好像真的醉了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"企業員工","speakerId":"avg_npc_223","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，我昏頭了，我實在......昏頭了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_220","isRemote":false,"text":"沒事。能看出來你確實不舒服，所以目前我還能忍得住不揍你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_220","isRemote":false,"text":"別拿這種事開玩笑......認真的，再被我聽到一次，今晚你就得去醫院接鼻樑骨了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"企業員工","speakerId":"avg_npc_223","isRemote":false,"text":"唉......不說了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"企業員工","speakerId":"avg_npc_223","isRemote":false,"text":"說句實話，其實我小的時候一直想當騎士來著。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"企業員工","speakerId":"avg_npc_223","isRemote":false,"text":"不是競技騎士，是更古老一點的......我爺爺那一輩人喜歡的那種。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_543_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是指前陣子進城的那些征戰騎士老爺？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"企業員工","speakerId":"avg_npc_223","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道我沒這個本領......唉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_543_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看開一點。這些打打殺殺的都過時了，單靠逞兇鬥狠能拼出的結果就那麼點......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_220","isRemote":false,"text":"誰說不是呢。但我們......不拼，也得拼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_220","isRemote":false,"text":"呼......老闆，再來一杯酒！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_543_1","isRemote":false,"text":"按我說，大家都想日子能過得好點，最好是能進個企業什麼的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"企業員工","speakerId":"avg_npc_223","isRemote":false,"text":"你想進企業？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_543_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我，嗯，算是吧。最好是個大企業，能坐辦公室上班那種。哎不過當銷售也行，我覺得我還挺擅長的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_543_1","isRemote":false,"text":"聽說大企業還給優秀員工獎金分紅，能安安穩穩拿年薪，多好！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_220","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，聽起來是不錯......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"企業員工","speakerId":"avg_npc_223","isRemote":false,"text":"......天真！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_543_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"企業員工","speakerId":"avg_npc_223","isRemote":false,"text":"在大企業幹活可沒有你們想的那麼簡單......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_543_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......這個嘛，我也就是做做夢，大家都知道想進企業不容易。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"企業員工","speakerId":"avg_npc_223","isRemote":false,"text":"想進是不容易，但這也是最簡單的一步，進去只不過是個開始。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"企業員工","speakerId":"avg_npc_223","isRemote":false,"text":"等你真正進去了，往往就走不掉了，這才是難......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"企業員工","speakerId":"avg_npc_223","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"企業員工","speakerId":"avg_npc_223","isRemote":false,"text":"我今天......其實曠工了，沒去上班。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"企業員工","speakerId":"avg_npc_223","isRemote":false,"text":"本來想請個假，但今年已經沒假期餘額了，所以乾脆沒請。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_543_1","isRemote":false,"text":"消失一整天，沒人給你打電話？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"企業員工","speakerId":"avg_npc_223","isRemote":false,"text":"電話沒電了。昨晚忘了充。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_543_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好傢伙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_220","isRemote":false,"text":"你這樣......真的沒問題嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"企業員工","speakerId":"avg_npc_223","isRemote":false,"text":"有問題，問題還挺大。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_220","isRemote":false,"text":"......那你也太坦然了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"企業員工","speakerId":"avg_npc_223","isRemote":false,"text":"哈......哈哈，我算坦然嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"企業員工","speakerId":"avg_npc_223","isRemote":false,"text":"我現在舌頭是麻的，胃是空的，腦子大概和這兩者相加差不多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"企業員工","speakerId":"avg_npc_223","isRemote":false,"text":"哦剛剛喝了酒，胃裡有酒，腦袋裡有水。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_220","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼亂七八糟的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_543_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我還蠻喜歡這個比喻的，別緻。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"企業員工","speakerId":"avg_npc_223","isRemote":false,"text":"不管怎麼說，我現在覺得也挺好的，聽不見鈴聲......至少可以假裝一切都沒問題。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_543_1","isRemote":false,"text":"恕我直言，那也只是現在，一時清淨而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_543_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等你給電話充上電......嘶，真有點不敢想。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"企業員工","speakerId":"avg_npc_223","isRemote":false,"text":"......別說了，我忽然覺得渾身發冷。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_220","isRemote":false,"text":"連我都開始覺得胃不舒服了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"企業員工","speakerId":"avg_npc_223","isRemote":false,"text":"隨便吧，我看開了。我這樣的員工要多少有多少，能力強的老員工和幹勁足的新人公司都不缺，耽誤不了什麼事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"企業員工","speakerId":"avg_npc_223","isRemote":false,"text":"我就是累了......想休一天，什麼都不管的那種休假。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"企業員工","speakerId":"avg_npc_223","isRemote":false,"text":"要是真因為這事就被裁，那也行，也省得我自己總是下不了決心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_543_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真這麼坦然？真不怕？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"企業員工","speakerId":"avg_npc_223","isRemote":false,"text":"......開玩笑的，當然怕，房子的貸款還沒還多少呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"企業員工","speakerId":"avg_npc_223","isRemote":false,"text":"所以我打算這就回家通宵寫檢討，明天交給部長，就說我重病昏迷了一天，電話不小心摔壞了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_543_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，有點假。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_220","isRemote":false,"text":"相當假！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"企業員工","speakerId":"avg_npc_223","isRemote":false,"text":"真不真假不假無所謂，大家有個台階下就行......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"企業員工","speakerId":"avg_npc_223","isRemote":false,"text":"行了，今天就到此為止吧，都別喝了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_220","isRemote":false,"text":"老闆，結帳......嘶，你們還真不客氣，都挑貴的喝啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_543_1","isRemote":false,"text":"多謝款待。哎呀，好不容易進城一次，又有朋友仗義請客，機會難得。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_543_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_543_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看在今晚的酒的分上，給你個建議。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_220","isRemote":false,"text":"給我什麼建議？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_543_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你今晚要不就在酒吧待著，我看了看，這裡通宵營業，客人不少。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_543_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等到白天了，再找個人多的地方......總之儘量往人群裡走。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"企業員工","speakerId":"avg_npc_223","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？什麼意思？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_543_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就這樣，我先告辭了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"企業員工","speakerId":"avg_npc_223","isRemote":false,"text":"他就這麼走了？也不解釋一下......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"企業員工","speakerId":"avg_npc_223","isRemote":false,"text":"欸，我也該回家了。你打算怎麼辦？真的要聽那傢伙說的，喝通宵？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_220","isRemote":false,"text":"我......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"老頭後來告訴我，他是玄鐵，看我應該可以做個青金。\n他是夠黑夠硬的，但我尋思著我也不青啊。唉，不能和老闆計較，青金就青金吧。\n老頭剛撿到我的時候——其實不能這麼說，因為我一個人活得挺好，本來也不需要被撿。\n總之那時候我剛獵了兩隻羽獸，燙掉毛，放乾血，就能在生好的火堆上烤來吃。\n結果好嘛，這老頭直接吃了一隻半，就留了兩個頭，一對爪子，還有一條大腿肉給我。\n吃完他就和那種故事裡的高人似的，開口就說：\n你這個年紀，沒人教，沒工具，卻能獵到這種精於閃躲，老練獵人都難獵到的羽獸，算是很有天賦了。\n怎麼樣，小孩，你想過上好日子嗎？\n——我想啊。怎麼能不想。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_sportsbar"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_220","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_220","isRemote":false,"text":"我也是昏頭了，竟然真的信了那人的話，耽擱了這麼久。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_220","isRemote":false,"text":"都快要天亮了......還是回去吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_23_G05"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_220","isRemote":false,"text":"嘶......好冷。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_220","isRemote":false,"text":"原來這個時候的大騎士領是這個樣子，半個人都沒有，只有滿地還沒打掃的垃圾和被隨便丟掉的騎士海報......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_220","isRemote":false,"text":"哈，大家都是垃圾......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_220","isRemote":false,"text":"——什麼人？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_220","isRemote":false,"text":"你們是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"無胄盟殺手","speakerId":"avg_npc_216","isRemote":false,"text":"鐵腕騎士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"無胄盟殺手","speakerId":"avg_npc_216","isRemote":false,"text":"拒不與聯合會合作，你擋了別人的路。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"無胄盟殺手","speakerId":"avg_npc_216","isRemote":false,"text":"血騎士已經沒法再護著你們了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"給他們賣命，時間越長，我看得就越清楚。\n騎士是他們貨倉裡囤積的商品，殺手是他們手底下拿捏的武器，輿論？輿論是最好操控的，他們已經把這些都研究透了。\n資金，權力，在卡西米爾，這兩樣往往被綁在一起。\n哎，我倒也不是說就一定想當大富豪，只是你看看，想要日子過得更好，就還是得擠進那群人裡才行。\n大多數人就這麼一層一層往上爬，可哪裡又能有不被掌控的自由？\n所以別想太多，有條件呢，就儘量讓自己過得更好一點，更舒服一點......\n至少從今往後，我不必再被一通電話要求去殺誰，萬一失誤，可能受傷不說，還要費心思糊弄老闆，是吧？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_windows"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫妮克","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"好了，你的臉沒問題了，睜眼吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅伊","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......嗯......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫妮克","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你再這麼做作地摸臉我會揍你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅伊","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哎，別啊，莫妮克閣下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅伊","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"臉上全是繃帶的感覺有點，嗯，新鮮。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫妮克","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"唐娜。唐娜·泰勒。你是約爾·泰勒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"唐娜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"等會醫生回來，別喊錯了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"約爾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"啊，那稱呼也得變一變了。我們是夫妻，是吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"唐娜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"約爾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你害羞了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"唐娜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你眼瞎了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"約爾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"別這麼凶嘛，雖然說這安排是有點......嗯，不過也可以啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"約爾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"而且我覺得你這張臉還是很漂亮的，放心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"唐娜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......你眼瞎了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醫生","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你醒了，適應得怎麼樣？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醫生","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你選擇的是加急的項目，雖然源石技藝可以加速這個過程，不需要長期分次進行手術，但對應的風險還是有的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醫生","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"近期還不能拆掉繃帶，之後最好是能一個月來進行一次後續保養，這樣可以確保最大限度的穩定......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"約爾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"謝謝，效果很好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"約爾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不過後續保養就不勞操心了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醫生","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"呃......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"約爾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我們會自己想辦法解決，辛苦了，醫生。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"唐娜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"真乾脆。屍體你自己想辦法解決。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"約爾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"沒辦法，這件事不能讓任何人知道，雖然那句話俗了點，但說得一點沒錯......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"約爾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"只有死人才能保守秘密。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"約爾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"說起來，你知道聯合會對一批追隨血騎士的感染者騎士下手的事嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"約爾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"昨晚碰到了一個，我稍微確認了一下......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"唐娜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"好像聽過。但與我無關。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"唐娜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"勸你也別多管，別忘了，現在我們和無胄盟沒關係了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"約爾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哎，這麼說也沒錯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"約爾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"已經和我們無關了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"約爾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"好了，接下來就要開始新生活了啊，我們怎麼辦，做銷售的話......真的要去跑業務嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"唐娜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"就算你想跑，玄鐵也不會同意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"唐娜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你不把我們的客人趕跑就謝天謝地了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"約爾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"搞不好我有這個才能呢？現在什麼都有了，總得再給自己找點事情做吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"唐娜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你很閒？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"約爾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"有點，不然我們倆去打獵怎麼樣？去鄉間買棟別墅，我教你獵羽獸，這事沒人能比我更擅長了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"約爾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"以前在樹林裡靠打獵為生的時候，可沒想過會有這麼出息的一天。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"約爾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"之前是沒這個空閒，現在可好，時間多得很，正好能好好過過癮。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"唐娜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你閒得慌，你自己去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"唐娜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我要休假，可能去多索雷斯或者汐斯塔，而不是什麼鄉下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"唐娜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"費了這麼多功夫，好不容易才有了今天，就是給你回味童年的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"唐娜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你圖什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"約爾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......這個嘛，誰知道呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"約爾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"能過得好一點就儘量過得好一點嘛，我沒想那麼多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"唐娜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......嘖，如果哪天你忽然腦子抽風要歸隱山林，名下的財產不要了可以直接轉給我。信用卡帳號回頭發你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"約爾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，按我們現在的身份，只要我哪天遭遇不測，遺產自然就歸你了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"唐娜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"有道理，就這麼辦吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"約爾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"真無情。不聊這個了，等我處理完眼下的事，剛才提到的度假，怎麼樣，考慮一下？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"約爾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"——你說要去哪，我們一起拼個團？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
